   },
   "skos:definition": "God's free, undeserved favour and the gift of his saving and transforming life, traced in Scripture from God's favour to Noah and his self-description as \"merciful and gracious\" in Exodus 34 to the grace that comes through Jesus Christ and saves \"through faith\"; Christian traditions agree that salvation begins in grace but describe how grace works in different ways.",
